								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							/cheer iniq<br /><br />Call of Ktulu and Orion are both amazing, especially the build up at the begining of Orion. Anyways, dont use something by Coldplay or JEW (lol) not that they arent good bands, but so trite, if you are going to use Coldplay, why not go with Good Riddance by Green Day perhaps the most overplayed sentimental song of ALL TIME.<br /><br />Zorl0
