		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=200" title="View the profile of Eelyen">Eelyen</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								The Overmind<br />
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 180<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.fotguild.com/images/avatars/eelavatar.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								The Overmind<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=200"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.fotguild.com" title="Fires of Time Guild" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1360.msg13490#msg13490"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1360.msg13490#msg13490">Re: It's been 6 years of Everquest now.  I need help, your help.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #22 on:</b> January 02, 2005, 01:31:41 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Btw if any of you have any good ideas for the movies feel free to email me or send me a tell in game.  I play on Morden Rasp now.    I&#039;m usually on in the evenings every day.  So just send a tell to ;tell morden.eelyenx if you want to talk.<br /><br />I will be giving credit to everyone who helps me in this flash endeavor.  I&#039;ve wanted to do this for a long time, but I don&#039;t have everything I need from the last 6 years.  Thats why I Came to yall.<br /><br />Please dig around in your screenshots and send me some.  From Ascent to Avatars of Discord to just a group of friends that play the game for fun.  I would like to add as many as possible.  I want to use atleast 2 songs in this flash, so thats a good 6-9 minutes of time to fill.  And I need screenshots to fill it.  And I don&#039;t want it to be all mine.<br /><br />Edit: <b>Btw</b> I appreciate all the song suggestions.&nbsp; I will be sure to listen to them all in the next week or two and try to decide the 2 or 3 best songs that will fit the movie I want.&nbsp; Also, the screenshots people send me will influence this decision.&nbsp; So do send them too me.&nbsp; &nbsp;I have TONS of space on that email.&nbsp; So if you can&#039;t convert them from BMP&#039;s, thats fine.&nbsp; In fact, if you send them to me in BMP format thats even better.&nbsp; &nbsp; As it will be at the best quality it was taken at.&nbsp; And I can convert it myself to the format I need.<br /><br />So send screenshots, please <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: January 02, 2005, 01:34:08 am by Eelyen</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
