								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1360.msg13509#msg13509">Re: It's been 6 years of Everquest now.  I need help, your help.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #26 on:</b> January 03, 2005, 11:38:56 am &#187;</span></td>
