								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							From the monkette who always greeted you&nbsp; long ago....Happy New Year Eeylen and nice idea .<br /><br /><br />Mirage did a wonderful job on original EQ movie. <br /><br />Shame I printed and sent a friend all my old world screenshots and then deleted them. I have a few left , one being casters in a battle in Lake Rathe Arena with Rallos Zek:)&nbsp; I hid behind a tree and FD&#039;d!!!<br /><br />When the GM saw me there I was promptly &quot;ported&quot;outside area to peer through crack in doors:).<br /><br />Take care
						</td>
					</tr>
