	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13584"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=345" title="View the profile of Dwalion SoulVoid">Dwalion SoulVoid</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 114<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								Gnomercy~!!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=345"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1360.msg13584#msg13584"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1360.msg13584#msg13584">Re: It's been 6 years of Everquest now.  I need help, your help.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #28 on:</b> January 08, 2005, 01:22:31 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Beginning of Metallica&#039;s One.<br /> <br />Beginning of Tesla&#039;s , crap I forgot, has nifty instrumental beginning.<br /><br />Hurt from Johnny Cash, NiN is okay, but his voice makes good for your latter days..creepy.<br /><br />Are you going to go for the Mufin type video with words scrolling across the bottom?&nbsp; Or your voice?<br /><br />I figure, you should stick to happier songs for the beginning of it and at the point you leave Ancient Souls, you should drop down to some sorrow riddled songs, well actually when you invited those two dikes from WoW, when I left the guild.&nbsp; EQ from that point went down a huge spiral to hell.&nbsp; At any rate, it might be hard to do it that way, like a truthful documentary, just try not to make it so fictional, that no one will recoginize it as a somewhat serious peice of EQ history, not some comical laughfest.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Dwalion SoulVoid &lt;Arirang&gt;<br />70 Necromancer <br /><br />You will more than likely post something stupid and I will respond with something witty.&nbsp; I will more than likely post something stupid and you will respond with something witty.
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13602"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=999" title="View the profile of tylishe">tylishe</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 1<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=999"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:tylishe@tampabay.rr.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1360.msg13602#msg13602"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1360.msg13602#msg13602">Re: It's been 6 years of Everquest now.  I need help, your help.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #29 on:</b> January 09, 2005, 12:47:06 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							This is a nice idea and I look forward to what you produce.&nbsp; My song suggestion is &quot;I&#039;ve Been High&quot; by R.E.M.&nbsp; The lyrics are below.&nbsp; Ironically, the first time I heard this was late at night, in game when I was talking with a close friend.&nbsp; &nbsp;I was entranced.&nbsp; The version out there is a little different from what I heard that night as Michael Stipe did it live, accoustically but it&#039;s still moving.&nbsp; If you can&#039;t find it on Limewire or somewhere, I&#039;ll post it for you on my site.<br /><br />have you seen?<br />have not, will travel.<br />have I missed the big reveal?<br /><br />do my eyes<br />do my eyes seem empty?<br />I&#039;ve forgotten how this feels.<br /><br />I&#039;ve been high<br />I&#039;ve climbed so high<br />but life sometimes<br />it washes over me.<br /><br />have you been?<br />have done, will travel.<br />I fell down on my knees.<br /><br />was I wrong?<br />I don&#039;t know, don&#039;t answer.<br />I just needed to believe.<br /><br />I&#039;ve been high<br />I&#039;ve climbed so high<br />but life sometimes<br />it washes over me.<br /><br />so<br />I dive into a pool so cool and deep that if I sink I<br />sink<br />and when I swim I fly so high<br /><br />what I want<br />what I really want is<br />just to live my life on high.<br /><br />and I know<br />I know you want the same<br />I can see it in your eyes.<br /><br />I&#039;ve been high<br />I&#039;ve climbed so high<br />but life sometimes<br />it washes over me.<br /><br />washes over me<br />close my eyes so I can see<br />make my make-believe believe<br />in me.<br /><br />Tylishe<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
